            desc = "Raw status of channel transfer completion interrupts of each channel. Bit[3:0] corresponds to channels 3-0. Read the register:
- 0: No interrupt is generated.
- 1: An interrupt is generated.

Write the register:
- 0: Reserve the previous values.
- 1: Clear channel transfer completion interrupts.

Access type RWC in the data sheet: written 1 clears the bit.";
            sw = rw; hw = w; onwrite = woclr;
            reset = 0x0;
        } int_tc1_raw[3:0];
    } INT_TC1_RAW @ 0x600;
